03:29.543 --> 03:33.171
Versi masa depan itu tidak pernah ada.

03:36.133 --> 03:40.011
THE CLAAMITY

03:41.930 --> 03:44.433
I 've lived my way full of shame

03:44.516 --> 03:48.854
